---
interface Props { title?: string; term?: string; }
const { title = '回应与讨论', term } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="comments" aria-labelledby="comments-title">
  <div class="comments-heading"><p class="eyebrow">CONVERSATION</p><h2 id="comments-title">{title}</h2><p>欢迎留下你的想法。评论由 GitHub Discussions 保存和管理。</p></div>
  <div class="giscus"></div>
  <script is:inline src="https://giscus.app/client.js" data-repo="Frees-Ling/Frees-Ling.github.io" data-repo-id="R_kgDOKMYMOQ" data-category="Announcements" data-category-id="DIC_kwDOKMYMOc4CctrR" data-mapping={term ? 'specific' : 'pathname'} data-term={term} data-strict="1" data-reactions-enabled="1" data-emit-metadata="0" data-input-position="top" data-theme="transparent_dark" data-lang="zh-CN" crossorigin="anonymous" async></script>
  <p class="comments-fallback">评论框没有显示？可以直接前往 <a href="https://github.com/Frees-Ling/Frees-Ling.github.io/discussions" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub Discussions</a> 参与讨论。</p>
</section>
<script>
  const updateGiscusTheme=()=>{const theme=document.documentElement.dataset.theme==='light'?'light':'transparent_dark';document.querySelector<HTMLIFrameElement>('iframe.giscus-frame')?.contentWindow?.postMessage({giscus:{setConfig:{theme}}},'https://giscus.app')};
  new MutationObserver(updateGiscusTheme).observe(document.documentElement,{attributes:true,attributeFilter:['data-theme']});
</script>
<style>
  .comments{margin-top:80px;padding-top:56px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.comments-heading{margin-bottom:32px}h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Georgia,"Songti SC",serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:550}.comments-heading>p:last-child{margin:0;color:var(--ink-soft)}.comments-fallback{margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:12px}.comments-fallback a{color:var(--cyan)}
</style>
